{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03143","headline":"晚憩王少府东阁 · 张九龄","name":"晚憩王少府东阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"披轩肆流览，云壑见深重。\n空水秋弥净，林烟晚更浓。\n坐隅分洞府，檐际列羣峰。\n窈窕生幽意，参差多异容。\n还慙大隐迹，空想列仙踪。\n赖此昇攀处，萧条得所从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}